<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A5" title="In Causal Decoding for Hallucination-Resistant Multimodal Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">E </span>Limitations and Future Work</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A6" title="In Causal Decoding for Hallucination-Resistant Multimodal Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">F </span>More Qualitative Examples</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
</nav>
<div class="ltx_page_main">
<div id="infobox" class="infobox">
