<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A6.F10.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 10</span>: </span><span id="A6.F10.8" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Case studies on hallucination reduction. </span></figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A6.F11" class="ltx_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
<div id="A6.F11.3" class="ltx_block ltx_figure_panel ltx_minipage ltx_align_center ltx_align_top" style="width:225.5pt;">
<p id="A6.F11.3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.F11.3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_align_center ltx_inline-block" style="width:225.5pt;"><img src="2602.21441v1/Figures/case_115637.jpg" id="A6.F11.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:262/197;" width="262" height="197" alt="Refer to caption"></span></p>
<p id="A6.F11.3.2" class="ltx_p">
<span id="A6.F11.3.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_middle" style="width:219.5pt;--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2F2;">
<span id="A6.F11.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A6.F11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bf z}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2F2;" mathbackground="#F2F2F2">𝐳</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bf z}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A6.F11.3.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">-vector:</span> [laptop: 0.88, bed: 0.86, suitcase: 0.63, keyboard: 0.44, mouse: 0.42, backpack: 0.36, handbag: 0.33, <span id="A6.F11.3.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">cell phone: 0.31</span>, remote: 0.15, person: 0.14, …]</span>
</span></p>
<p id="A6.F11.3.3" class="ltx_p">
<span id="A6.F11.3.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_middle ltx_framed ltx_framed_rectangle" style="width:218.7pt;">
<span id="A6.F11.3.3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.F11.3.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">LLaVA: </span> A <span id="A6.F11.3.3.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#008000;">bed</span> with a <span id="A6.F11.3.3.1.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#008000;">laptop</span> and a <span id="A6.F11.3.3.1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#C00000;">cell phone</span> on it. The <span id="A6.F11.3.3.1.1.5" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#008000;">bed</span> is unmade and has a striped blanket. There is also a <span id="A6.F11.3.3.1.1.6" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#008000;">suitcase</span> on the <span id="A6.F11.3.3.1.1.7" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#008000;">bed</span>, and a pair of glasses nearby.</span>
</span></p>
<p id="A6.F11.3.4" class="ltx_p">
